{"4429930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Water You Doing?", "steam_appid": 4429930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/65bc24ab0486d50bd0a4edfb9d53742d.avif?t=1788260021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras_big/65bc24ab0486d50bd0a4edfb9d53742d.webp?t=1788260021 width=1560 height=535 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/dee6a8de49e1a5c885b1ce4d950858d8.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/dee6a8de49e1a5c885b1ce4d950858d8.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/dee6a8de49e1a5c885b1ce4d950858d8.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You and your crew got the party location wrong, and your ride broke down. Navigate through unforgiving waters using a beat-up ship that will from now on serve as your new, musty home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/c3fc55fd9f35b6e6f4ee9dbdb42125d3.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/c3fc55fd9f35b6e6f4ee9dbdb42125d3.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/c3fc55fd9f35b6e6f4ee9dbdb42125d3.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This won't be an easy task, however, as you'll be facing the greatest enemy of primary school students: physics. Add to that falling boulders, sea mines, dangerous fauna, and much, much more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d02f0af1fc8859204abe8877d0cb33bf.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d02f0af1fc8859204abe8877d0cb33bf.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d02f0af1fc8859204abe8877d0cb33bf.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortunately, the ship is equipped with a harpoon system that is sure to help you overcome even the toughest obstacles. The number of harpoons will increase as the game progresses, allowing for a creative approach to the problems you encounter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d920f59ee32ebe3cc155d22f563167ad.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d920f59ee32ebe3cc155d22f563167ad.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d920f59ee32ebe3cc155d22f563167ad.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Since this is a trip out on the water, fishing is an absolute must. Sell your fish to buy items that will make your survival easier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/4ffc988315543b1ab5477df15ba11517.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/4ffc988315543b1ab5477df15ba11517.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/4ffc988315543b1ab5477df15ba11517.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use gathered wood and scrap to repair the boat so you don't sink before reaching your destination. Remember to take care of yourself, too—but if things go south, all is not lost! Your crew can revive you using a Golden Fish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/73afc108176ec0ef2ada658a2fb0634a.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/73afc108176ec0ef2ada658a2fb0634a.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/73afc108176ec0ef2ada658a2fb0634a.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, though, that the destination isn't the most important thing; it's the journey and the company you keep along the way. The more you stray off the beaten path, the more items you'll be able to gather—and maybe you'll even uncover the secret of Laba the Frog.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/58d59c2a286d47b66ad3b2057730143a.avif?t=1788260021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras_big/58d59c2a286d47b66ad3b2057730143a.webp?t=1788260021 width=1560 height=703 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/65bc24ab0486d50bd0a4edfb9d53742d.avif?t=1788260021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras_big/65bc24ab0486d50bd0a4edfb9d53742d.webp?t=1788260021 width=1560 height=535 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/dee6a8de49e1a5c885b1ce4d950858d8.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/dee6a8de49e1a5c885b1ce4d950858d8.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/dee6a8de49e1a5c885b1ce4d950858d8.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You and your crew got the party location wrong, and your ride broke down. Navigate through unforgiving waters using a beat-up ship that will from now on serve as your new, musty home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/c3fc55fd9f35b6e6f4ee9dbdb42125d3.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/c3fc55fd9f35b6e6f4ee9dbdb42125d3.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/c3fc55fd9f35b6e6f4ee9dbdb42125d3.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This won't be an easy task, however, as you'll be facing the greatest enemy of primary school students: physics. Add to that falling boulders, sea mines, dangerous fauna, and much, much more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d02f0af1fc8859204abe8877d0cb33bf.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d02f0af1fc8859204abe8877d0cb33bf.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d02f0af1fc8859204abe8877d0cb33bf.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortunately, the ship is equipped with a harpoon system that is sure to help you overcome even the toughest obstacles. The number of harpoons will increase as the game progresses, allowing for a creative approach to the problems you encounter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d920f59ee32ebe3cc155d22f563167ad.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d920f59ee32ebe3cc155d22f563167ad.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/d920f59ee32ebe3cc155d22f563167ad.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Since this is a trip out on the water, fishing is an absolute must. Sell your fish to buy items that will make your survival easier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/4ffc988315543b1ab5477df15ba11517.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/4ffc988315543b1ab5477df15ba11517.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/4ffc988315543b1ab5477df15ba11517.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use gathered wood and scrap to repair the boat so you don't sink before reaching your destination. Remember to take care of yourself, too—but if things go south, all is not lost! Your crew can revive you using a Golden Fish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/73afc108176ec0ef2ada658a2fb0634a.poster.avif?t=1788260021\" width=790 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/73afc108176ec0ef2ada658a2fb0634a.webm?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/73afc108176ec0ef2ada658a2fb0634a.mp4?t=1788260021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, though, that the destination isn't the most important thing; it's the journey and the company you keep along the way. The more you stray off the beaten path, the more items you'll be able to gather—and maybe you'll even uncover the secret of Laba the Frog.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras/58d59c2a286d47b66ad3b2057730143a.avif?t=1788260021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/extras_big/58d59c2a286d47b66ad3b2057730143a.webp?t=1788260021 width=1560 height=703 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Your ride is dead, and rough waters lie ahead! Survive aboard a musty boat in a totally chaotic co-op. Collect scrap, patch up leaks, swap your catch for cold brews, and use harpoons to break the laws of physics!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Hindi<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/b96746dd012d8dfa1df0ce52afd9dc1187b24a51/header.jpg?t=1788260021", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/111a36e77a7eb23c2776c187d14ef2b85c00ab4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788260021", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429930/111a36e77a7eb23c2776c187d14